                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Love this game - as will anyone who loved Uridium on the C64 or Spectrum. Been playing more on XBox One than Steam, but both games seem identical. Frantic blasting - leave brain at the door and just go for it! Excellent revamp of a classic game.\nMy only niggle would be the C64 and Spectrum graphics mode - I can't seem to get them without having a CRT TV effect applied, which makes the visuals horrendous! If I'd have had a CRT TV like that back in the day I'd have returned it to Dixons!\nBut hey - the different graphics modes are a bonus!",
